// pfodWeb NOTE: per-board override — this is a Waveshare ESP32-S3
// Touch AMOLED board. Removed from the chip-level default chipGpios
// map: QSPI display (9-14,21), touch/RTC I2C (47,48, shared), RTC_INT (15), QMI8658 IMU INT (8).
// (GPIO32-37, the internal PSRAM/Flash SPI, would already be
// excluded chip-wide, but this board's own file declares
// SS/MOSI/MISO/SCK there directly, so they're trusted/kept per
// this project's audit policy.) Full copy of
// variants/esp32/esp32s3/board.json otherwise.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard BOOT button (pinout table KEY_IO column = "BOOT0") per Waveshare wiki https://www.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43 Onboard Resources item 13 "BOOT button" / Interfaces pinout table. No onboard user-controllable LED found on this board (only fixed charge/power indicator LEDs, item 9/11, not GPIO-driven) - left untagged.
